OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for migrant camp at ex-RAF
OL,4,Abase to be drawn up
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetailed plans for a proposed migrant
OL,7,Fcamp in Suffolk are to be drawn up
OL,8,Fafter the Home Office awarded a #3.4m
OL,9,Fcontract.
OL,11,FConstruction giant Kier has been hired
OL,12,Fto design the camp at RAF Barnham, a
OL,13,Fformer nuclear weapons store near
OL,14,FThetford, Norfolk, earmarked for asylum
OL,15,Fseekers.
OL,17,FThe revelation has raised fresh
OL,18,Fconcerns about the amount of public
OL,19,Fmoney being spent on the base before a
OL,20,Ffinal decision has been made, the Local
OL,21,FDemocracy Reporting Service said.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
