OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for migrant camp at ex-RAF
OL,4,Abase to be drawn up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office, which recently cut the
OL,7,Fnumber of migrants planned for the site
OL,8,Ffrom 1,250 to 931, insists no decision
OL,9,Fhas yet been taken.
